{"unit_id":"SamizuHM__dsh-client-ui-theme-xp#feature-feature-1","repo":"SamizuHM/dsh-client-ui-theme-xp","commit":"3cc412f4e877c127dea2e5b6e3413e5ddc95ce97","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-theme-xp 的功能「XP桌面主题」：主题将 DSH 网页客户端固定为明亮的 Luna 配色，并改写字体、按钮、滚动条、提示框和会话标题栏样式。插件应用时注入样式表。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:36","client.js:2148"]}
{"unit_id":"SamizuHM__dsh-client-ui-theme-xp#feature-feature-2","repo":"SamizuHM/dsh-client-ui-theme-xp","commit":"3cc412f4e877c127dea2e5b6e3413e5ddc95ce97","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-theme-xp 的功能「浮动会话窗口」：点击侧栏会话后会在桌面中打开独立窗口；窗口支持拖动、调整尺寸、最小化、最大化、关闭，任务栏可切换或恢复窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1142","client.js:959","client.js:1007"]}
{"unit_id":"SamizuHM__dsh-client-ui-theme-xp#feature-feature-3","repo":"SamizuHM/dsh-client-ui-theme-xp","commit":"3cc412f4e877c127dea2e5b6e3413e5ddc95ce97","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-theme-xp 的功能「工作区与会话浏览」：双击桌面上的“我的工作区”可浏览工作区及其中会话，也能在选定工作区中新建会话并打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1280","client.js:1322","client.js:1360"]}
{"unit_id":"SamizuHM__dsh-client-ui-theme-xp#feature-feature-4","repo":"SamizuHM/dsh-client-ui-theme-xp","commit":"3cc412f4e877c127dea2e5b6e3413e5ddc95ce97","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-theme-xp 的功能「会话内容搜索」：在桌面搜索窗口输入关键词并提交后，插件调用 sessions.search 展示匹配会话和摘要；点击结果可打开该会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1381","client.js:1401","client.js:1426"]}
{"unit_id":"SamizuHM__dsh-client-ui-theme-xp#feature-feature-5","repo":"SamizuHM/dsh-client-ui-theme-xp","commit":"3cc412f4e877c127dea2e5b6e3413e5ddc95ce97","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-theme-xp 的功能「添加本地工作区」：点击“添加工作区”后调用系统目录选择器，选中目录后通过 workspaces 服务创建工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1438","client.js:1452"]}
{"unit_id":"SamizuHM__dsh-client-ui-theme-xp#caveat-caveat-1","repo":"SamizuHM/dsh-client-ui-theme-xp","commit":"3cc412f4e877c127dea2e5b6e3413e5ddc95ce97","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-theme-xp 使用前须知：桌面 Bliss 壁纸通过 ia800706.us.archive.org 外部地址加载；其余主题界面由浏览器插件本地渲染。（见 client.js:331）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:331"]}
